{{Quote|The job? It's simple. Help us cause a little trouble for the Empire&mdash;specifically on a planet with an Imperial outpost barely keeping peace over a local populace that doesn't want them there.|Margo, to T'onga|<ref name="Bounty Hunters 28">[[Bounty Hunters 28|''Bounty Hunters'' 28]]</ref>}}
A major '''Imperial naval base''',<ref name="Bounty Hunters 29" /> also referred to as an '''Imperial outpost''',<ref name="Bounty Hunters 28" /> was located on [[Jahnae]] on the [[Inner Rim Territories]] [[planet]] [[Bestine IV]].<ref name="Bounty Hunters 29" /> Serving as a [[shipyard]], it was constructed by the Empire to quell rebel incursions in the Inner Rim after the region saw much [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist Alliance]] activity during the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="EW Guide">''[[Entertainment Weekly's Ultimate Guide to Rogue One]]''</ref> It was rumored to be a research and development facility where weapons of war were made. The presence of the base drove off many locals<ref name="Bounty Hunters 29" /> including the independent merchant and future [[rebel pilot]] [[Jek Tono Porkins|Jek Porkins]] to abandon Bestine IV.<ref name="HC79">{{HelmetCollectionCite|79|Helmets}}</ref>

Between [[3 ABY]] and [[4 ABY]],<ref name="Date" /> the criminal syndicate [[Crimson Dawn]] learned that the outpost was barely keeping peace over its local populace, which according to [[Margo]], did not want the [[Galactic Empire]] there. Margo later provided the [[bounty hunter]] [[T'onga]], who was in need of [[Galactic Credit Standard|credits]] for her [[T'onga's crew|crew]],<ref name="Bounty Hunters 28" /> with a [[Mission to Bestine IV|job]] to intercept an Imperial shipment of munitions that was being sent to the base to use and crush a local [[Insurrection on Bestine IV|insurrection]],<ref name="Bounty Hunters 29" /> in the hopes it would upend the fragile balance between the Empire and the Bestine population.<ref name="Bounty Hunters 28" /> The base was destroyed after the [[transport]] was sent to the base at full speed after T'onga's crew, along with help from [[Beilert Valance]], who had gone [[Desertion|rogue]] from the Empire, defeated the Imperial defenders of the transport.<ref name="Bounty Hunters 30">[[Bounty Hunters 30|''Bounty Hunters'' 30]]</ref>

